---
description: Meridian modernization rules for all agent work in this repository
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow AGENTS.md at the repository root. Highlights:
- legacy/ is read-only; golden and *.approved.* files are human-owned.
- Behaviour must not change unless the task says so and names an approver.
- Package versions only from Directory.Packages.props; never guess a version.
- Done means: `dotnet build Meridian.slnx -warnaserror` and `dotnet test --solution Meridian.slnx` pass.
